{
  "name": "A journey from rural roots to academic triumph",
  "parent_id": 203313772661931,
  "group_id": "da0b3ad2-3581-4552-8c3a-fc1e0bb46182",
  "alternates": [],
  "created_at": "2026-07-31T09:41:35.322Z",
  "deleted_at": null,
  "sort_by_date": null,
  "tag_list": [],
  "updated_at": "2026-08-12T14:59:09.865Z",
  "published_at": "2026-08-12T14:59:09.849Z",
  "id": 203986105682438,
  "uuid": "92b5df71-00b3-4e94-ad45-5d9d5d5d4b51",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "eb64d6e6-1949-66b4-c8b0-2bcdd5087c66",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "1f3acf49-a6e4-13ae-fd5d-024c8bf187ed",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"Raised in a middle-class family, I faced hurdles typical for girls in rural areas. Yet, armed with ambition, I pursued higher education at the Institute of Business Administration (IBA) in Sukkur, where I graduated with distinction and a bronze medal adorning my achievements.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "But the dream didn't stop there. Despite societal pressures and familial expectations of early marriage, my thirst for knowledge persisted. Before I received my acceptance letter Aga Khan University Institute for Educational Development (AKU-IED), pursuing a master's degree seemed unachievable.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "My time at AKU-IED was not just about academic pursuits; it was also a demonstration of the institution's unwavering support and nurturing environment. Despite financial constraints, AKU-IED's financial assistance programme paved the way for my MPhil journey, transforming academic aspirations into reality.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Though I initially desired international study opportunities, AKU-IED quickly became my sanctuary. The institute not only relieved financial pressures, but also provided a familial support system, especially during trying times like the floods back home.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The educational journey at AKU-IED was nothing short of transformative. Every aspect of the programme, from exploring educational philosophy to developing research skills under the guidance of a supportive supervisor, shaped my academic and personal growth.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "What sets AKU-IED apart is its holistic approach to education. Access to top-notch healthcare and counselling services ensured not just physical well-being but also nurtured mental health-a crucial aspect often overlooked in academic settings.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "AKU-IED also opened doors to global opportunities, from summer exchange courses in the USA to presenting research papers in Hawaii. Beyond academics, the institute provided support for personal growth and a sense of community.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "In essence, AKU-IED is more than an educational institution; it's a beacon of hope, a nurturing haven where dreams take flight. From overcoming societal norms to forging academic connections, my time at AKU-IED was a transformative chapter that sculpted not just my academic journey but also my identity and aspirations.\"",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
